{"id":"esgoto","lemma":"esgoto","pos":"noun","rank":3941,"glosses":["sewer (for waste liquid)"],"ipa":"/(i)ʒˈɡo.tu/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"esgotos"},"examples":[{"text":"Este lugar cheira a esgoto.","en":"This place smells like a sewer.","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"place"},{"g":"to smell","l":"cheirar"},{"g":"the / to"},null]},{"text":"Ouvi que havia jacarés no esgoto.","en":"I heard that there were alligators in the sewers.","words":[{"g":"to hear","l":"ouvir"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},null,{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"Os esgotos frequentemente poluem o mar.","en":"Sewage often pollutes the ocean.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"frequently, often"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"sea"}]}]}